  "description": "Dial your equipment, and nail your ride. You'll be cleaning the gnarliest lines on our new 140 mm Long Travel 4-Bar Linkage frame with upgraded suspension adjustments. The 2017 Shift R7 LT is one smooth operator, with higher-end Rockshox, FSA and Ritchey components package designed around advanced Shimano SLX 1x11 technology and no flex, no fuss 12mm rear thru-axle wheelset.\nNew Shift R LT 6061-T6 alloy 4-Bar linkage frame, 140mm rear travel, tapered 1.5\" head tube, 73mm BB shell, 12mm thru-axle dropouts\nInternal cable routing\nRockShox Monarch RL DebonAir rear shock w/ rebound adjuster and lockout\nNew Rockshox Sektor Gold RL 27.5 fork, Solo Air, 140mm travel, w/ remote lockout\nRitchey Comp Logic Zero Press-Fit 1-1/8\" / 1.5\" headset\nNew FSA V-Drive Modular crankset w/ 32T Megatooth alloy chainring\nNew Shimano SLX 1x11-spd rear derailleur, Shadow Plus\nNew Shimano SLX 1x11 shifter & 11-spd 11-42T cassette\nWTB Rocket Comp saddle\nRitchey Trail alloy cockpit w/ Trail WCS Lock-Ring grips\nKenda Nevegal X 27.5x2.35, 60tpi tires\nLight Weinmann U28 rims\nUpper chain guide",
